<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
<img src="2510.10528v1/fig/wizard.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:25/25;" width="25" height="25" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Merlin’s Whisper</span>: Enabling Efficient Reasoning in LLMs via 
<br class="ltx_break">Black-box Adversarial Prompting
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:2.0pt;--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">1</span><span id="id3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Caution: this paper includes adversarial text that may be considered offensive.</span>
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
