<span id="A2.T4.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T4.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">BeConcise</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.T4.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:150.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T4.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within <math id="A2.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\backslash" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>\</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\backslash</annotation></semantics></math>boxed{}. Be concise.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
