<td id="A2.T6.2.7.11" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.7.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">61.7</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.7.12" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.7.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">11340</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.7.13" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.7.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">97.2%</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.7.14" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.7.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">84.0</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.7.15" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.7.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">88.9%</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.2.8" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">AdvPrompt</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">94.6</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">482</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">30.4%</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">93.5</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">2157</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">46.8%</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">93.4</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.9" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">4088</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.10" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">54.9%</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.11" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">64.2</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.12" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">8196</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.13" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">70.2%</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.14" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">86.4</span></td>
<td id="A2.T6.2.8.15" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T6.2.8.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EFF7FC;">58.9%</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Experimental results of <span id="A2.T6.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AdvPrompt</span> on Qwen3-4B. We report accuracy (<span id="A2.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Acc.</span>), average token usage (<span id="A2.T6.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Tok.</span>), and compression ratio for comparison. Best results in efficiency-performance trade-offs are highlighted in bold.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ B.3 Details of Main Results ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details ‣ Merlin’s Whisper: Enabling Efficient Reasoning in LLMs via Black-box Adversarial Prompting1Caution: this paper includes adversarial text that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ B.3 Details of Main Results ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details ‣ Merlin’s Whisper: Enabling Efficient Reasoning in LLMs via Black-box Adversarial Prompting1Caution: this paper includes adversarial text that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> present additional experimental results on the DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen series and Qwen3-4B, respectively. Across four reasoning benchmarks, <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AdvPrompt</span> consistently achieves an average compression ratio of <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="77\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>77</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">77\%</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A2.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="81\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>81</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">81\%</annotation></semantics></math> on the DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen series. Notably, for simple GSM8K questions, <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AdvPrompt</span> achieves a <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="2.5\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.5\times</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A2.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="2.7\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.7</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.7\times</annotation></semantics></math> reduction in token usage. Similarly, <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AdvPrompt</span> demonstrates substantial efficiency gains on Qwen3-4B, achieving a <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="3.3\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3.3\times</annotation></semantics></math> token reduction on GSM8K and an average <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="1.7\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.7</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.7\times</annotation></semantics></math> reduction across all four benchmarks. These results underscore the effectiveness of <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AdvPrompt</span> in improving inference efficiency, yielding a relative increase in response efficiency of <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25\%</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A2.SS3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="32\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">32\%</annotation></semantics></math> compared with existing baselines.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.10528v1/perspectives2.png" id="A2.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:452/720;" width="452" height="720" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Compression ratios (%) of top-<math id="A2.F8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math> prompt candidates across perspectives.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Additional Results for Different Perspectives</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A2.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ B.3 Details of Main Results ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details ‣ Merlin’s Whisper: Enabling Efficient Reasoning in LLMs via Black-box Adversarial Prompting1Caution: this paper includes adversarial text that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> illustrates the compression ratios achieved by Qwen3-14B and Deepseek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B using the top-<math id="A2.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math> prompt candidates generated from each adversarial perspective. Consistent with the findings in Section <a href="#S6.SS1" title="6.1 Effectiveness of Different Perspectives ‣ 6 Analysis ‣ Merlin’s Whisper: Enabling Efficient Reasoning in LLMs via Black-box Adversarial Prompting1Caution: this paper includes adversarial text that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.1</span></a>, prompts based on the <span id="A2.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evidence</span>-based persuasion technique consistently yield the best compression results within the Qwen3 series. For DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, aside from the <span id="A2.SS4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evidence</span> perspective, the <span id="A2.SS4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Instruction-I</span> prompt ranks among the top-<math id="A2.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math> candidates across all perspectives.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F9" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.10528v1/PDSet.svg" id="A2.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:452/512;" width="452" height="512"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>The average token usage of LRMs increases linearly with their token usage on the <span id="A2.F9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PDSet</span>, with a coefficient of determination close to <math id="A2.F9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}=0.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}=0.9</annotation></semantics></math>. Results are derived from the first refinement iteration of <span id="A2.F9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">instruction</span> candidates.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.5 </span>Effectiveness of <span id="A2.SS5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PDSet</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We conducted additional experiments to validate the reliability of our selected <span id="A2.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PDSet</span>. As shown in Figure <a href="#A2.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ B.4 Additional Results for Different Perspectives ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details ‣ Merlin’s Whisper: Enabling Efficient Reasoning in LLMs via Black-box Adversarial Prompting1Caution: this paper includes adversarial text that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, token usage on the <span id="A2.SS5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PDSet</span> strongly correlates with the average response length of LRMs across four benchmarks, exhibiting a near-linear relationship (<math id="A2.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}\approx 0.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}\approx 0.9</annotation></semantics></math>). These experimental results underscore the effectiveness of <span id="A2.SS5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PDSet</span> in evaluating adversarial prompt candidates.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</article>
</div>
</div>
